	"title": "A message queue as a marble run",
	"label": "Marble run: slender producer towers with hopper cups over notched collars feed open troughs into a funnel collar; a shallow sloping lane holds queued marbles behind a two-peg escapement; three troughs fan to drums. Drag sets the rate.",
